# Reproducible checkouts (security repair 2026-09-30, audit F-18/F-27): every text file is checked out with LF
# line endings on every OS. Without this, Windows clones (core.autocrlf=true) got CRLF and the SQL validators and
# local test harness failed on a fresh checkout. Binary files are detected automatically and left untouched.
* text=auto eol=lf
